cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Visual Tests for Amblyopia: Psychophysics Test Battery"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB/Psychtoolbox battery of psychophysical tests used to assess visual
  function before and after dichoptic VR training in a study of visual
  plasticity in adult amblyopia: cut-off spatial frequency, contrast
  sensitivity, interocular imbalance, dichoptic noise tolerance, stereoacuity
  (Asteroid) and tumbling-E acuity (isolated and crowded). Designed for a
  passive-polarised stereo display (Display++) with optional EyeLink
  eye tracking.
authors:
  - family-names: Fars
    given-names: Julien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7771-5029"
    affiliation: University of Oxford
repository-code: "https://github.com/julienfars/visual_tests_amblyopia"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - amblyopia
  - psychophysics
  - Psychtoolbox
  - MATLAB
  - contrast sensitivity
  - interocular suppression
  - stereoacuity
  - visual acuity
